# Fixture integrity manifest (E03-T06).
#
# One line per recorded fixture used by the `integration` CI job / pytest
# `integration` suites: "<sha256-hex>  <repo-relative-path>". Verified by
# `tools/ci/verify_fixture_manifest.py` before any fixture-driven test runs
